[{"text": "至少是亲生的。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱NB", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "也就是说是肚子里的“我“想吃吗", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "小馋猫", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "告诉老莫，我想吃鱼了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "是纯爱！我们有救啦！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.8, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "何意味", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.5}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "是的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "何意味你冯呢何意味", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"conflict": 0.6, "attack": 0.4}, "dominant": "conflict", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "！？鱼鱼？！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.3, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "此事在叉叉的视频中亦有记载", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.6, "humor": 0.4}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "吃爽了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这么可爱", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "台下观众欣喜若狂", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "虽然有点不理解，但台下观众欣喜若狂", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "？！爱爱！？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你信吗？反正我是不信。一看就知道是编的。挑了两条最大的。一个妇女怎么可能两条都吃完？更何况不可能只吃鱼吧。在这不就两条鱼吗？吃就吃了，正常人谁会觉得亏欠？就算会觉得亏欠，也不至于哭吧。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"conflict": 0.7, "attack": 0.3, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "conflict", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "胃口挺好", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我也是，我妈怀上我之后就很爱吃鸡肉。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "鱼：所以我也是你们play的一环吗？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你想吃", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱nb", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "应该是说生在了一个用爱筑就的家庭", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "information": 0.4}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "都说酸儿辣女，问题是我妈怀我的时候基本上是顿顿辣椒不离嘴，怀我弟的时候是顿顿醋不离嘴，剩下的是果不其然，我特别爱吃辣椒，而且而且特别能吃辣no。我弟直特别能吃醋。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "information": 0.3, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "还真是，我妈生我妹妹的时候天天吃鱼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你这个贪吃的小鬼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我家鼠标垫就是这个图", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.4, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "那烤的很好吃了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.3, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "盲目吃鱼之神", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "最后一句话封神了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "？？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "所以你怎么知道世界上有鱼的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "妈妈是盲目吃鱼之神", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "来姨妈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.5}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我半个月的工资不足以去市场放开了吃鱼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4, "humor": 0.3, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "啧", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "什么雷霆动静", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.3, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱NB！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这算不算爱屋及乌？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.3, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "还好孕期敏感的妈妈遇到了一位好丈夫", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "母爱是世界上最纯真的爱", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.8}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "好家伙，是你让我老婆哭的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "NONONO!治疗药水对亡灵生物有伤害！不~", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我半个月的工资够买400斤罗非，放开了吃。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5, "humor": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "王不哭，王不闹，王不语，王要买烟，王不走楼梯，王从天降，王掷地有声，王一声不吭，王粘地上，王扣不下来", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这不就是你想吃鱼，所以让妈妈吃鱼吗？所以你一定叫艾伦·耶格尔对吧", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "母爱的伟大", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈妈在怀上我的时候，经济条件还不是怎么好，然后我爸爸给我妈妈买肉夹馍吃，然后他吃特别开心，然后导致我现在非常爱吃肉夹馍和米线", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱无敌", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈妈第一次怀孕？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.4, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "搜索：叉叉", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "好小子,是你馋啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这鱼得有多好吃啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.3, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "王不哭，王不闹，王想喝可乐，王不走楼梯，王不坐电梯，王发现水泥地挑衅，王从天降，我们掷地有声，王粘在地上，王扣不下来", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱牛逼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱实在是太棒了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "对的对的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "难。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.4}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "注∶本视频没有一只鱼受到伤害", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "怀孕的人很敏感。可能因为一件偶尔的小事就有很大的情绪波动。并且烙印在记忆当中。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.8}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈怀孕的时候喜欢吃西瓜，一次半个，到我这，现在一次一个", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "合着是你个小混蛋啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "attack": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "莫名其妙的，说的啥呀？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.4, "conflict": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你那天吃了三条鱼！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈妈(第一次？)，你是怎么知道的？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "other": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "叉叉（那个画纯爱故事的up）有一期画过的作品就是以这个为原型的吧", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.8}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "很幸福啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我刚打开视频就发现了三个问题", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.4, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "是纯爱呀纯爱万岁！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "鱼：你怎么这么自私", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "红色高跟鞋？纯爱nb！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "谁不喜欢吃鱼，闹麻了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"conflict": 0.5, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "conflict", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这个文案比叉叉的视频出的早", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.8}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "鱼鱼的种类特别多，难吃的其实才占大多数", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "并不喜欢吃鱼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.3}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱牛逼！！！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "祝福你", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "注意你已经看过这个很多次了，但仍然想把他看完", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "懂了，我妈怀我的时候没吃好，而我，什么都不爱吃", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你吃的啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.3, "other": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱万岁", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈怀我的时候特别喜欢吃水果，而我也特别喜欢吃水果", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "因为妈妈吃多了鱼我才会喜欢吃鱼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4, "information": 0.4}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "兄弟们 我看过叉叉的视频", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.6}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你看你馋的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "讲什么东西啊？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.4, "conflict": 0.2}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我说你咋知道呢，你小子", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "脖子有点痒，找跟绳子", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我啥都能吃，除了杨葱，苦瓜，茄子，南瓜，其他都能吃，最爱吃辣。和老妈一样。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "评论区那个喊我呱呱吗，说不过直接拉黑真闹麻了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"conflict": 0.7, "attack": 0.3}, "dominant": "conflict", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "王从天降，掷地有声", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "带着近卫步兵第272团走遍全b站！(9716)", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "合着是你这个小馋猫啊，贪吃鬼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "其实也～～～～～不喜欢吃鱼～～～", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.3, "other": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "sos", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.8}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "+ +-", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "‘", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱统治世界！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "？？？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "艹，纯爱NB", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.8}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "妈妈把之前的事跟现在的我说了呗。。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.45, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.45, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈妈原本不爱吃猪蹄，但在怀我的期间却一次吃了30斤", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.6, "humor": 0.2, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "合着是你馋啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "从来牛逼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈怀我特别爱吃葡萄", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "爷们！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈喜欢吃火锅，我也很喜欢吃火锅", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来并不是妈妈喜欢吃鱼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.3, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你这个小馋猫", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你这么自私吃了两条居然还嫁祸给你妈，还让你爸吃不着了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱牛逼。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.8}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "《第一次》", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "她肚子里的小馋猫，想吃鱼", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.4, "humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这让我想起来我弟，我弟上辈子应该属黄鼠狼的他特别爱吃鸡", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "information": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你想吃呀！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "好小子，原来你是馋了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你馋的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "幸福的小馋猫", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "嘿嘿嘿，她能一口气吃两条鱼我高低得再买几条看她吃", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "6", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.8}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "MVP", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是肚子里面的，喜欢吃", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.4, "humor": 0.3, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你呀，小馋猫", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "对的对的，特别是清汤鲫鱼煲汤，那鲜美，别提了！我还经常称呼它为坐月子的汤，因为我偶尔看到孕妇也在喝", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.8, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你真是个小馋猫啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7, "humor": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "有点像那个小说《小人物，怎么办》", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "啊？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.7}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "神他妈盲目吃鱼之神", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.9}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.9, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "NB！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "好小子，原来是你插啊。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "德古拉你又输了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "等一下？第一次怀孕？主角还没生出来呢！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "看给你馋的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "←术术人", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.7}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "意外發現up的身世", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "?", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我跳了兄弟们", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.6}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "意气风发啊，老爸", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "666居然是你馋", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "钞能力还是太权威了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "纯爱！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.8}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "……幽默完了，还辐射真就一点脑子不带的……", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.6, "conflict": 0.5, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "王不哭，王不闹，王要抽烟，王在天台抽烟，王从天降！掷地有声！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "有点奇怪的表达方式，不过最后却是升华了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.3, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "姐姐，怎么不涂色呀？我画画都要涂色呢，白色不好看，黑色也不好看", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.3, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "配偶给孕妇买吃的，是应该的呀！", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛   阿彌陀佛 阿彌陀佛", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 1.0}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 1.0, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "不要对亡灵生物使用治疗药水呀，你这家伙", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.9}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "看过叉叉的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.6}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "省流：大馋小子", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5, "humor": 0.6}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "2026/929/2231观看。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.7}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "爸妈辛苦了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.9}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我妈生我的时候特别喜欢吃水果，现在我每天也要吃水果，不然感觉浑身刺挠。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "@叉叉", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"other": 0.8}, "dominant": "other", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "666在这等着呢", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "逆天", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4, "humor": 0.3, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "舔狗", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.8}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "多好呀", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.7}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "就是你小子", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原来是你", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "孕妇孕期情绪波动很大……", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "合着是你这个馋嘴子啊", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}]